{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id36247496"}, "name":{"label":"heskiwi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-15T19:47:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.4"}, "id":{"label":"9826663019"}, "title":{"label":"My long term preference for podcast."}, "content":{"label":"I’m along-time user of podcast software and look closely at features on a regular basis. And I have used Overcast almost exclusively since at least 2014. I have been able to access any podcast that I have wanted to listen to, except for those limited to walled gardens. The flexibility of using multiple playlists, lots of options on how many episodes to hold of each podcast, and playback features that speed my listening such as suppressing silence and high speed playback. No other app I have found has the strong combination of features. \nThe one feature I want to be added? Marking short segments for notes, and useful transcriptions. If I could combine Snipd with Overcast all my needs would be met!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
